CRYPTOGRAPHY NOTICE

foSSH contains cryptographic functionality (BLAKE3 hashing, HMAC-style
request authentication, ChaCha20-Poly1305 authenticated encryption,
SHA-256, constant-time comparison). You are responsible for compliance
with the import, export, and use regulations of your own jurisdiction.

