BUNDLED THIRD-PARTY CODE

SQLite (via the `libsqlite3-sys` crate's `bundled` feature, which
vendors and compiles the SQLite amalgamation source directly into the
binary): SQLite is public domain. See https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html.
No separate attribution is required by SQLite's own terms; noted here
for completeness.

No offline country/GeoIP database is bundled as of this release —
`country` resolution is not yet wired up (tracked in DECISIONS.md /
DURUM.md); when one is added, its required attribution will be
reproduced here exactly as that database's license mandates, per
§19.4.8.

